message: >-
  If you use these data, models or code, please cite this record and the article by
  Kumagai et al. (doi:10.1103/PhysRevMaterials.5.123803) from which every DFT value is derived.
type: dataset
title: >-
  Data, models and code for: Oxygen-vacancy formation energies in non-magnetic oxides:
  how much do explicit electronic descriptors add to graph networks as training data grows?
