abstract: >-
  Processed inputs, splits, job specifications, trained checkpoints, per-site predictions, result records
  and code for a study of graph-network prediction of neutral oxygen-vacancy formation energies in
  non-magnetic oxides, as a function of the number of training hosts. All DFT values come from the
  oxygen-vacancy database of Kumagai et al. (Phys. Rev. Materials 5, 123803, 2021; CC BY 4.0).
  No new DFT calculations were performed. Derived data are released under CC BY 4.0 and code under MIT.
  No external funding was received. This work used resources of the National Research Platform (NRP).
repository-code: https://github.com/pa1aash/dft-gnn
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
